to do the long term equity

00:14:01.453 --> 00:14:04.908
for having legacy over short term profit.

00:14:04.908 --> 00:14:07.975
I think the most interesting
thing for this audience

00:14:07.975 --> 00:14:10.700
and your show and what I
grew up with in the mid-2000s

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.178
